## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Scaffold | **Vite 5** (`create-vite`) | Instant HMR, zero config, fastest dev server |
| UI Framework | **React 18** | Component-based, reusable sections |
| Language | **TypeScript 5** | Type-safe props, strict data models |
| Styling | **CSS Modules** (vanilla) | Scoped styles, no runtime overhead, matches your `#0F172A` design system |
| Animation | **Framer Motion 11** | Scroll-reveal, stagger, counter animations |
| Icons | **Lucide React** | Crisp SVG icons, tree-shakable |
| Fonts | **Google Fonts** (Inter + Outfit) | Via `<link>` in `index.html` |
| Linting | **ESLint + TypeScript-ESLint** | Code quality, auto-fixable |
| Formatting | **Prettier** | Consistent code style |
| Deployment | **GitHub Pages / Vercel** | Zero-config static deploy |

> [!NOTE]
> Tailwind CSS is **not used** as per your preference for the design control a custom CSS system provides. CSS Modules give per-component scoping with zero class-name collisions.

