## Animations Strategy (Framer Motion)

| Animation | Component | Trigger |
|---|---|---|
| Staggered fade-up | Hero text blocks | On mount |
| Typewriter effect | Hero `<h1>` | On mount |
| Animated counter | Hero metrics (40%, 35%) | `useInView` |
| Scroll-reveal fade+slide | Every section | `useInView` (once) |
| Stagger children | Skill cards, cert grid | `useInView` |
| Height collapse | Experience bullet expand | Click toggle |
| Hover lift + glow | Project cards | `whileHover` |
| Page exit/enter | None (SPA, no routing) | — |

`SectionWrapper` wraps each section and applies `initial`, `whileInView`, `viewport={{ once: true }}` so animations fire once on first scroll-into-view.

